只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness bundle plugin: process-discipline system-prompt section + deterministic progress nudge for silent tool steps","id":"gh:1426698085","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-progress-rules","slug":"Adamaik/dsh-progress-rules","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness bundle plugin: process-discipline system-prompt section + deterministic progress nu"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"dge for silent tool steps"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-progress-rules"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) bundle plugin that\nmakes agents report progress instead of silently running"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" dozens of tool steps."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Two independent layers, both mounted by one bundle row:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. **System-prompt section** — `user:progress-rules` at order `10150` (after the Web surface\nsection"},{"id":"p7s2","text":", before the deployment persona suffix). It carries your process-discipline rules and\nis re-rendered"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" on every request, so conversation compaction can never summarize it away.\nIt uses its own section n"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ame, so a preset's `@deepseek-ai/dsh-persona` row cannot shadow it\nthe way it shadows the deployment"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"s `@deepseek-ai/dsh-persona` row cannot shadow it\nthe way it shadows the deployment `personaSuffix`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"2. **Deterministic nudge** — on every `agent/pre-step`, the plugin checks whether the previous\nassis"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tant message contained any text block. If it only carried tool calls (or reasoning),\nthat step count"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"s as *silent*. After `everySteps` consecutive silent steps it injects one\nuser-role reminder into th"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"e next admitted step: \"you ran tools without reporting, narrate in\n1–3 sentences before continuing\"."},{"id":"p8s5","text":" The reminder is a durable context message rendered as a\n`progress-rules` context row, not as a mess"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"age from the user. Any narrated step resets the\ncounter."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The first layer is advisory for the model. The second layer is what actually breaks the\n\"40 silent s"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"teps\" pattern, because the harness inserts the reminder itself instead of trusting\nthe model to reme"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"n, because the harness inserts the reminder itself instead of trusting\nthe model to remember a rule."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"DSH plugins are installed into a **profile** (`$DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>`), not globally:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then add the bundle to the profile's `package.json` (order matters: bundles compose in list\norder, s"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"o put it after the base bundles):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart DSH afterwards. If your DSH build ships the `dsh plugin` command, adding the dependency\nand "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"the bundles entry is what that command does for you."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The bundle patch (`cordis.patch.yml` inside this package) declares one row:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Override it from the profile's `cordis.patch.yml` by targeting the same row id. Patch semantics\nrepl"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ace the **whole** row config, so restate every key you keep:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `text` | bundled Chinese rules | System-prompt section text. Empty drops the section. |\n| `name` |"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" `user:progress-rules` | Section name. |\n| `order` | `10150` | Section order (WEB_SURFACE is 10100, "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"persona suffix 10200). |\n| `enforce` | `true` | `false` disables the per-step nudge, leaving only th"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"e prompt section. |\n| `reminder` | bundled one-liner | Text injected before a silent step. Empty dis"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ables the nudge. |\n| `everySteps` | `5` | Consecutive silent steps before one reminder. `1` = every "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"step, larger = quieter. |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Why not AGENTS.md or `personaSuffix`?"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **`AGENTS.md`** is loaded as a durable user message in conversation history. On long tasks DSH\ncom"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"paction may summarize it away; the system prompt is never compacted.\n- **`system-prompt.personaSuffi"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"x`** is shadowed for preset sessions: the shipped Standard / PTC /\nMinimal presets mount `@deepseek-"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ai/dsh-persona`, which registers the same\n`deployment:persona-suffix` section with empty text, hidin"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"g the deployment value. A differently\nnamed section avoids that entirely."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Tested with DSH `0.2.1-rc.2`, Standard preset, `deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud`.\n- Plain ESM, no C"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ordis imports, no runtime dependencies; uses `node:crypto`.\n- The nudge detects silence by checking "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"text blocks in the last assistant message. A provider\nthat reports assistant text in a custom block "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"type would not be recognized — open an issue."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
